# Kylox's Voltstrider: the cards its collect-evidence cost exiled are exiled with that object, not with a new one (CR 607.2a,
# 400.7). Bot1 collects evidence with Hill Giant, Lightning Bolt and Faithless Looting (4 + 1 + 1), Unsummons the animated
# Vehicle back to hand and casts it again: the new Voltstrider has no cards exiled with it, so when it attacks, crewed by two
# Memnites, its trigger offers nothing and the Bolt and the Looting stay exiled. Bot2 takes the first Bolt and the Vehicle's 4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Kylox's Voltstrider
Faithless Looting
Lightning Bolt
Memnite
Hill Giant
Grizzly Bears
Unsummon
Island
Memnite
Island x5

